w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-0.5"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 text-subheadline text-text-secondary truncate" style="opacity:1;filter:blur(0px)">Show thinking</div></div><span class="text-text-secondary flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden" data-testid="thinking-status-chevron"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" width="20" height="20"><path d="M12.38 24.62a.877.877 0 0 0 1.238 0l8-8a.876.876 0 0 0 0-1.239l-8-8a.876.876 0 0 0-1.238 1.238L19.76 16l-7.38 7.381a.877.877 0 0 0 0 1.238z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div><div class="-ms-[25px] flex flex-col ps-px" data-testid="subagent-cot-list" data-subagent-list-phase="live" data-subagent-pulse-direction="down" style="--subagent-cot-pulse-length-px:0px;--subagent-connector-branch-window-top-px:14px;--subagent-cot-pulse-top-px:0px"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="w-full min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div dir="auto" class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p>No — <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">MiB is bigger than a kilo</span>.</p>
<p>If you're talking data size:</p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">kilo (kB) = 1,000 bytes</span></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">KiB = 1,024 bytes</span></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">MiB (Mebibyte) = 1,024 KiB = 1,048,576 bytes</span></li>
</ul>
<p>So:<br>
<span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">1 MiB = 1,024 KiB = 1,048.576 kB</span></p>
<p>MiB is about 1,048x bigger than a kilobyte.</p>
<p>If you meant:</p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">1 Kilo = 1000</span> of something</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">1 Mibi = 1,048,576</span> of that something</li>
</ul>
<p>So MiB is always bigger.</p>
<p>Were you comparing file sizes, internet data, or something else like kilos of weight vs. data?</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="group/assistant-message-actions mx-auto flex min-h-11 max-w-3xl flex-wrap items-center select-none"><div data-slot="flexbox" class="min-h-0 min-w-0 flex items-center gap-x-1 gap-y-1 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:-ms-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="contents"><button aria-label="Like this response" class="enabled:active:scale-98 inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-round focus:not-focus-visible:outline-none transition-transform duration-150 ease-in-out disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 select-none size-7 hover:enabled:bg-fill-secondary-elevated enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.965)] dark:enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.9)] text-text-secondary" data-slot="tooltip-trigger" data-state="closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" class="m-0.5" size="20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="m10.894 6.447 1.715-3.429c.56.107.939.669.794 1.247L13.04 5.72l-.988 2.964A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h6.53a.7.7 0 0 1 .436 1.246l-.526.421a1.09 1.09 0 0 0-.226 1.457.818.818 0 0 1-.19 1.108l-.624.468a1 1 0 0 0-.294 1.247l.105.211a1 1 0 0 1-.447 1.342l-.211.106a1 1 0 0 0-.502 1.21l.092.276a.69.69 0 0 1-.655.908h-4.204a4.515 4.515 0 0 1-3.192-1.323A5.727 5.727 0 0 0 5.042 17H4a1 1 0 1 0 0 2h1.042c.988 0 1.936.393 2.636 1.092A6.515 6.515 0 0 0 12.284 22h4.204a2.69 2.69 0 0 0 2.67-3.025 3.004 3.004 0 0 0 1.06-3.138l.006-.005a2.819 2.819 0 0 0 1.015-3.043A2.7 2.7 0 0 0 19.53 8h-5.142l.562-1.684a.993.993 0 0 0 .021-.073l.373-1.493A3.018 3.018 0 0 0 12.416 1c-.634 0-1.213.358-1.496.925L9.127 5.51l-1.3 2.08A3 3 0 0 1 5.283 9H4a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h1.283a5 5 0 0 0 4.24-2.35l1.325-2.12a.977.977 0 0 0 .046-.083z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="contents"><button aria-label="Dislike this response" class="enabled:active:scale-98 inline-