<p>Do you also want me to make your pink ruffle bag's trim this extra fluffy too?</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="animate-in fade-in-0 min-w-0 duration-300 ease-out"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="group/assistant-message-actions mx-auto flex min-h-11 max-w-3xl flex-wrap items-center select-none"><div data-slot="flexbox" class="min-h-0 min-w-0 flex items-center gap-x-1 gap-y-1 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:-ms-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="contents"><button aria-label="Like this response" class="enabled:active:scale-98 inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-round focus:not-focus-visible:outline-none transition-transform duration-150 ease-in-out disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 select-none size-7 hover:enabled:bg-fill-secondary-elevated enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.965)] dark:enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.9)] text-text-secondary" data-slot="tooltip-trigger" data-state="closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" class="m-0.5" size="20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="m10.894 6.447 1.715-3.429c.56.107.939.669.794 1.247L13.04 5.72l-.988 2.964A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h6.53a.7.7 0 0 1 .436 1.246l-.526.421a1.09 1.09 0 0 0-.226 1.457.818.818 0 0 1-.19 1.108l-.624.468a1 1 0 0 0-.294 1.247l.105.211a1 1 0 0 1-.447 1.342l-.211.106a1 1 0 0 0-.502 1.21l.092.276a.69.69 0 0 1-.655.908h-4.204a4.515 4.515 0 0 1-3.192-1.323A5.727 5.727 0 0 0 5.042 17H4a1 1 0 1 0 0 2h1.042c.988 0 1.936.393 2.636 1.092A6.515 6.515 0 0 0 12.284 22h4.204a2.69 2.69 0 0 0 2.67-3.025 3.004 3.004 0 0 0 1.06-3.138l.006-.005a2.819 2.819 0 0 0 1.015-3.043A2.7 2.7 0 0 0 19.53 8h-5.142l.562-1.684a.993.993 0 0 0 .021-.073l.373-1.493A3.018 3.018 0 0 0 12.416 1c-.634 0-1.213.358-1.496.925L9.127 5.51l-