uyiEZCgRvCLRrvxg\u0026oe=6AAC49AC\u0026_nc_sid=a21977\",\"mime_type\":\"image/webp\",\"media_id\":\"1369134296274409\",\"width\":1984,\"height\":1280},\"source\":{\"source_type\":\"IMAGE_GEN\",\"source_display_name\":\"gallery/foldover_beanie_macro.webp\"},\"content_hash\":\"compare:gallery/sage_green_plaster_wall.webp\",\"follow_up_pills\":[{\"prompt_text\":\"Add soft pastel background\",\"category\":\"SCENE\"},{\"prompt_text\":\"Enhance knit texture detail\",\"category\":\"LIGHT\"},{\"prompt_text\":\"Apply vintage sepia tone\",\"category\":\"STYLE\"},{\"prompt_text\":\"Add floral embroidery accent\",\"category\":\"ADD\"},{\"prompt_text\":\"Crop to focus on hat\",\"category\":\"FRAME\"},{\"prompt_text\":\"Add ribbon bow decoration\",\"category\":\"ADD\"}]}}},{\"view_model\":{\"__typename\":\"GenAISingleLayoutViewModel\",\"primitive\":{\"__typename\":\"GenAIMarkdownTextUXPrimitive\",\"text\":\"Same extra-close macro, smooth fluffy pink \u0026 white yarn, centered white octagonal table with pink crochet rug, clean refined smooth wall on the right, brown-roof house behind silver railing, no card — everything sharp and premium.\\n\\nYour final locked default for all products:\\n**Smooth yarn + extra-close macro + centered white table + pink rug + refined clean wall + no card**\\n\\nWant me to keep this as the permanent default for everything you send?\"}}},{\"view_model\":{\"__typename\":\"GenAISingleLayoutViewModel\",\"primitive\":{\"__typename\":\"GenAIMarkdownTextUXPrimitive\",\"text\":\":::follow_up_prompts {\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Lock this as final default for all products\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Make lighting even brighter\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Show both beanies side by side with refined wall\\\"}]}:::\"}}}],\"embedded_screens\":[{\"secondary_screen_id\":1,\"content\":[{\"__typename\":\"FOAEmbeddedScreenContentTabbed\",\"tabs\":[{\"sections\":[],\"tab_header\":\"Steps\",\"id\":\"steps\",\"step_entries\":[{\"__typename\":\"GenAIStepThoughtEntry\",\"header\":\"Composing balcony scene\",\"body\":\"I'm arranging the pink and white striped foldover crochet beanie on its wooden stand, placing it on the pink rug atop the white octagonal table, with the brown tiled roof, silver railing, and smooth light sage-grey wall framing the extreme macro shot.\"},{\"__typename\":\"GenAIStepThoughtEntry\",\"header\":\"Rendering macro composite\",\"body\":\"I'm putting together the extreme close-up with the foldover pink and white striped beanie on the wooden stand, centered on the pink crochet rug over the white octagonal table, with the blurred silver railing, brown roof house, and sage-grey wall behind.\",\"artifacts\":[{\"__typename\":\"GenAIImagePrimitive\",\"preview_image\":{\"url\":\"https://scontent.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t58.90637-1/741413832_1752583459313721_4440420744478198505_n.webp?_nc_ht=scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_cat=109\u0026_nc_ohc=MsjP7t_mrPcQ7kNvwHCUH4S\u0026sdl=0\u0026ccb=14-4\u0026oh=00_AQKiZVbZyVLz2yltm0WDMoIpU9cHVYbwDqnkqx5Mxt2hzQ\u0026oe=6AA835D3\u0026_nc_sid=a21977\",\"mime_type\":\"image/webp\",\"media_id\":\"1369134296274409\"},\"full_image\":{\"url\":\"https://scontent.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t58.90637-1/741413832_1752583459313721_4440420744478198505_n.webp?_nc_ht=scontent.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_cat=109\u0026_nc_ohc=MsjP7t_mrPcQ7kNvwHCUH4S\u0026sdl=0\u0026ccb=14-4\u0026oh=00_AQKiZVbZyVLz2yltm0WDMoIpU9cHVYbwDqnkqx5Mxt2hzQ\u0026oe=6AA835D3\u0026_nc_sid=a21977\",\"mime_type\":\"image/webp\",\"media_id\":\"1369134296274409\"},\"source\":{\"source_type\":\"IMAGE_GEN\",\"source_display_name\":\"gallery/foldover_beanie_macro.webp\"}}]}]}]}]}]}a1:T563,{\"response_id\":\"fbfd0efc-84a3-4b9f-a480-26aa824fdf5b\",\"sections\":[{\"view_model\":{\"__typename\":\"GenAISingleLayoutViewModel\",\"primitive\":{\"__typename\":\"GenAIBotThinkingStatusPrimitive\",\"title\":\"Show thinking\",\"is_in_progress\":false,\"icon\":\"THINKING\",\"target_secondary_screen_id\":\"DETAILS\",\"target_secondary_screen_tab_id\":\"STEPS\",\"show_answer_now\":false}}},{\"view_model\":{\"__typename\":\"GenAISingleLayoutViewModel\",\"primitive\":{\"__typename\":\"GenAIMarkdownTextUXPrimitive\",\"text\":\"No — **MiB is bigger than a kilo**.\\n\\nIf you're talking data size:\\n\\n- **kilo (kB) = 1,000 bytes**\\n- **KiB = 1,024 bytes**\\n- **MiB (Mebibyte) = 1,024 KiB = 1,048,576 bytes**\\n\\nSo:\\n**1 MiB = 1,024 KiB = 1,048.576 kB**\\n\\nMiB is about 1,048x bigger than a kilobyte.\\n\\nIf you meant:\\n- **1 Kilo = 1000** of something\\n- **1 Mibi = 1,048,576** of that something\\n\\nSo MiB is always bigger.\\n\\nWere you comparing file sizes, internet data, or something else like kilos of weight vs. data?\"}}}],\"embedded_screens\":[{\"secondary_screen_id\":1,\"content\":[{\"__typename\":\"FOAEmbeddedScreenContentTabbed\",\"tabs\":[{\"sections\":[],\"tab_header\":\"Steps\",\"id\":\"steps\",\"step_entries\":[{\"__typename\":\"GenAIStepThoughtEntry\",\"header\":\"Comparing data units\",\"body\":\"I'm breaking down kilo versus MiB for the user, noting kilo means 1,000 while MiB is 1,048,576 bytes, so MiB is much larger than a kilobyte.\"}]}]}]}]}90:{\"data\":{\"conversation\":{\"id\":\"405d2234-b8a3-4112-aca3-f81e8093a0cd\",\"isUnread\":false,\"latestBranchPath\":\"128\",\"messages\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"id\":\"405d2234-b8a3-4112-aca3-f81e8093a0cd_7504824249445782633_user\",\"__typename\":\"UserMessage\",\"turnId\":\"572b5aae-5a2c-486a-9617-a833e616c1bf\",\"__isMessage\":\"UserMessage\",\"branchPath\":\"119\",\"userContent\":\"nevermind\",\"userCreatedAt\":\"2026-09-13T08:52:13.959Z\",\"originalUserPrompt\":null,\"promptType\":\"initial_prompt\",\"parentRequestId\":null,\"afterCommentaryIndex\":null,\"attachments\":null,\"content\":\"nevermind\",\"reaction\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-13T08:52:13.959Z\",\"repliedSelectedText\":null,\"repliedMessageId\":null,\"conversationId\":\"405d2234-b8a3-4112-aca3-f81e8093a0cd\",\"mentions\":null,\"sender\":null,\"currentViewer\":{\"id\":\"1c02d7d6-09db-44e6-a714-c5436a69452c\"},\"ca