,{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Make the lighting brighter and softer\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"image\\\"}]}\u003c/ui-widget\u003e\"}},\"debugPariscopeUrl\":null,\"debugFbTraceId\":null,\"unified_response\":\"$9f\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-13T08:54:10.522Z\",\"error\":null},\"cursor\":\"405d2234-b8a3-4112-aca3-f81e8093a0cd_7504824738344248188_assistant\"},{\"node\":{\"id\":\"405d2234-b8a3-4112-aca3-f81e8093a0cd_7504824903842359444_user\",\"__typename\":\"UserMessage\",\"turnId\":\"68b0ae51-f523-43e8-98b9-d02ab822166f\",\"__isMessage\":\"UserMessage\",\"branchPath\":\"125\",\"userContent\":\"yes\",\"userCreatedAt\":\"2026-09-13T08:54:49.980Z\",\"originalUserPrompt\":null,\"promptType\":\"initial_prompt\",\"parentRequestId\":null,\"afterCommentaryIndex\":null,\"attachments\":null,\"content\":\"yes\",\"reaction\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-13T08:54:49.980Z\",\"repliedSelectedText\":null,\"repliedMessageId\":null,\"conversationId\":\"405d2234-b8a3-4112-aca3-f81e8093a0cd\",\"mentions\":null,\"sender\":null,\"currentViewer\":{\"id\":\"1c02d7d6-09db-44e6-a714-c5436a69452c\"},\"canCopy\":true,\"canEditPrompt\":false,\"canSharePrompt\":true},\"cursor\":\"405d2234-b8a3-4112-aca3-f81e8093a0cd_7504824903842359444_user\"},{\"node\":{\"id\":\"405d2234-b8a3-4112-aca3-f81e8093a0cd_7504824903842359445_assistant\",\"__typename\":\"AssistantMessage\",\"lastSeenMessageId\":\"28930556086562354\",\"uniqueMessageId\":\"7504824903842359445\",\"turnId\":\"68b0ae51-f523-43e8-98b9-d02ab822166f\",\"__isMessage\":\"AssistantMessage\",\"branchPath\":\"126\",\"assistantCreatedAt\":\"2026-09-13T08:54:49.980Z\",\"isUserPreferred\":null,\"requestId\":\"8ae65b94-4032-449a-971e-bef7879ceaf6\",\"threadMessageId\":\"mid.$gAAWbv0YVDtKmyz-d5mgmfnzfB2iV\",\"externalMessageId\":\"68b0ae51-f523-43e8-98b9-d02ab822166f\",\"streamingState\":\"DONE\",\"conversationId\":\"405d2234-b8a3-4112-aca3-f81e8093a0cd\",\"content\":\"Perfect match — foldover beanie now with your refined wall:\\n\\n![image](container:///mnt/data/gallery/foldover_beanie_macro.webp)\\n\\nSame extra-close macro, smooth fluffy pink \u0026 white yarn, centered white octagonal table with pink crochet rug, clean refined smooth wall on the right, brown-roof house behind silver railing, no card — everything sharp and premium.\\n\\nYour final locked default for all products:\\n**Smooth yarn + extra-close macro + centered white table + pink rug + refined clean wall + no card**\\n\\nWant me to keep this as the permanent default for everything you send?\\n\\n\u003cui-widget\u003e{\\\"type\\\":\\\"follow_up_suggestions\\\",\\\"suggestions\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Lock this as final default for all products\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"image\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Make lighting even brighter\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"image\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Show both beanies side by side with refined wall\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"image\\\"}]}\u003c/ui-widget\u003e\",\"botFeedbackKind\":null,\"hasPrivateSocialContent\":false,\"hasSocialTool\":false,\"canShare\":true,\"canPost\":true,\"canShareResponse\":true,\"images\":[],\"videos\":[],\"contentRenderer\":{\"__typename\":\"UnifiedResponseContentRenderer\",\"unified_response\":{\"__typename\":\"XMSGGenAIUnifiedResponse\",\"sections\":[{\"__typename\":\"GenAIUnifiedResponseSection\",\"message_group\":null,\"view_model\":{\"__typename\":\"GenAISingleLayoutViewModel\",\"primitive\":{\"__typename\":\"GenAIBotThinkingStatusPrimitive\",\"__isGenAIUXPrimitive\":\"GenAIBotThinkingStatusPrimitive\",\"title\":\"Show thinking\",\"is_in_progress\":false,\"icon\":\"THINKING\",\"meta_search_apps\":null,\"target_secondary_screen_id\":\"DETAILS\",\"target_secondary_screen_tab_id\":\"STEPS\",\"thought_duration_sec\":null,\"thought_text\":null,\"subagents_cot\":null,\"auto_close_secondary_screen\":null,\"show_answer_now\":false,\"subtitle_detail\":null,\"subtitle_artifacts\":null,\"sources\":null},\"__isGenAIUnifiedResponseSectionViewModel\":\"GenAISingleLayoutViewModel\"},\"header\":null},{\"__typename\":\"GenAIUnif